### Test 1: Save Temporary Onboarding Data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/onboarding/save-temporary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pregnancy_status": "tracking",
  "last_period": "2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "cycle_length": 28,
  "period_length": 5,
  "health_goals": "{\"track_period\": true, \"cycle_insights\": true}",
  "notifications": true
}

### Test 2: Register with Onboarding Data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test-onboarding@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "onboardingData": {
    "pregnancy_status": "tracking",
    "last_period": "2025-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "cycle_length": 28,
    "period_length": 5,
    "health_goals": "{\"track_period\": true, \"cycle_insights\": true, \"pregnancy_planning\": false}",
    "notifications": true
  }
}

### Test 3: Complete Onboarding with Registration (Session-based)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/onboarding/complete-with-registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "YOUR_SESSION_ID_HERE",
  "email": "session-test@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567891"
}

### Test 4: Get User Onboarding Data (after verification)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Test 5: Verify Email (complete the registration)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test-onboarding@example.com",
  "verify_code": "YOUR_VERIFICATION_CODE"
}
